WEBVTT

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:05.500
Colombia is the only South American country bordering both the Caribbean Sea and Pacific Ocean.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:11.000
In the Quindío region, towering Quindío Wax Palms rise across the verdant Cocora Valley.

00:00:11.500 --> 00:00:17.000
Historic Cartagena on the Caribbean coast is defended by 11 kilometers of colonial stone ramparts.

00:00:17.500 --> 00:00:23.000
Traditional attire includes the Sombrero Vueltiao handwoven from caña flecha cane fibers.

00:00:23.500 --> 00:00:29.000
Cumbia and Vallenato rhythms are played with accordion, guacharaca scraper, and caja drum.

